<title>ZIMBABWE: Five die in Zimbabwe plane crash.</title>
<headline>Five die in Zimbabwe plane crash.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five people were killed when their single-engine Cessna 185 plane crashed near Victoria Falls in northwestern Zimbabwe, police reported on Friday.</p>
<p>They said the five Zimbabweans, including the pilot, were on a flight around the falls when the plane developed engine problems and nosedived into the ground, killing all on board.</p>
<p>They all worked for a Safari company based in Victoria Falls.</p>
</text>
